# ---- blank-cost flood alert (BH-1020, hub only — the default IS the ticket) ----
# bin/cost-reconcile.sh's hourly run pages once per runner per UTC day when MORE
# than this many rc=0 cost rows arrive with an empty cost_usd in the hour. That
# is spend reading as $0.00 on every cost view, and it means either a box has
# not synced the write-time pricer (cost_row_price) or the model has no rate in
# catalog/model-prices.json. 0 turns the pass off; the whole script still has
# RECONCILE=0 and flags/cost-reconcile-off. Non-numeric falls back to 20.
#RECONCILE_BLANK_ROWS_MAX=20
